### One point of a scan with equal bands (lead_lowE_scan_def.mac): leadScanEvents muons of
### leadScanE GeV, normalised to the band leadScanE -+ leadScanHalfBand (GeV)

/control/subtract leadScanLow {leadScanE} {leadScanHalfBand}
/control/add leadScanHigh {leadScanE} {leadScanHalfBand}
/tof/cosmic/energyMin {leadScanLow} GeV
/tof/cosmic/energyMax {leadScanHigh} GeV
/tof/cosmic/monoEnergy {leadScanE} GeV
/OutputFile leadscan_t{leadT}_E{leadScanE}
/run/beamOn {leadScanEvents}
